WEBVTT

26:30.866 --> 26:32.701
Why do you read so much?

26:32.826 --> 26:35.954
Look at me and tell me what you see.

26:37.247 --> 26:39.166
Is this a trick?

26:40.417 --> 26:43.003
What you see is a dwarf.

26:43.128 --> 26:46.298
If I'd been born a peasant they might've
left me out in the woods to die.

26:46.423 --> 26:50.552
Alas, I was born a Lannister
of Casterly Rock.

26:50.677 --> 26:52.637
Things are expected of me.

26:52.762 --> 26:55.182
My father was the Hand of the King
for 20 years.

26:55.307 --> 26:57.350
Until your brother killed that king.
